  "description": "Reverse a string such that only English letters are swapped.",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "1: let chars = s.split('')\n2: let left = 0, right = chars.length - 1\n3: while (left < right) {\n4:   if (!isLetter(chars[left])) left++\n5:   else if (!isLetter(chars[right])) right--\n6:   else swap(chars, left++, right--)\n7: }",
